# m2asc commits

Format (guideline, not rigid):

```text
area - subarea, what was done/introduced/fixed
```

Examples:

- `backend - conversion, add pixel to character mapping`
- `frontend - ui, add image upload zone`
- `docs - plan, mark step 2.1 completed`

Rules:

- Prefer short, outcome-focused subjects (about one line)
- On `/m2asc-ship`, use this format and include the plan leaf status → `✅` in the same commit as the code
- Do not invent Conventional Commit prefixes (`feat:`, `fix:`) unless the user asks
